o stimulation of phagocytosis of apoptotic retinal pigment epithelium (RPE) cells and macrophages."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}